From 4b6faf06d70fbdf97393abc887b7b4468998cb46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 8 May 2026 11:11:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(scripts): sync leaderboard data from
 react-doctor-benchmarks

Adds scripts/sync-leaderboard.ts which fetches results/leaderboard.json from
millionco/react-doctor-benchmarks (or a local file) and writes it to the
website at packages/website/src/app/leaderboard/leaderboard-data.json plus
splices a top-10 markdown table into the package README between the
<!-- LEADERBOARD:START --> / <!-- LEADERBOARD:END --> markers. Idempotent:
no write happens when the rendered output is byte-identical.
