Adds a top-10 leaderboard between the LEADERBOARD:START / LEADERBOARD:END
markers in packages/react-doctor/README.md, populated from the latest
results/leaderboard.json in millionco/react-doctor-benchmarks. The full
leaderboard with raw JSON for every run lives in the benchmarks repo.
